// ── QFORGE-NC MEASURED λ (the live-rollup side of the scoreboard) ─────────────
// The scoreboard (qforge_migration_scoreboard) reports the QFORGE-NC composed
// real-cell λ ALONGSIDE the QE reference and classifies each anchor. These are
// the HONEST as-found composed values, NOT the L0-identity placeholder the
// ci_gate harness uses. A sentinel < 0.0 means "qforge-pending" (no composed λ
// measured for that anchor yet) → the scoreboard renders PENDING, never PASS.
//
// PROVENANCE (CaH6, verbatim from QFORGE-FEATURE.log.md, d6/g63 — NOT tuned):
//   composed real-cell xval (cah6_realcell_compose_xval.hexa, real ω(q,ν) band +
//   off-diag 10×10 + real N(E_F)=77.3948, bare ΔV, NPW=64 ground SCF converged):
//   QFORGE-NC composed λ = 0.0895675 · rel-ε vs QE 4.376 = 0.9795 (~49× under).
//   Root cause of the 49× NAMED (not fixed): Γ-only-vs-full-4×4×4q BZ + NPW
//   undersampling (calibration RULED OUT — clean-metal Al/Nb/Pb controls validate
//   the same back-end, PR#2508+). Gate CaH6-NC stays HELD (PARTIAL, not flipped).
//   cite: hexa-lang PR#2502 (4fa6afdc9) + PR#2503 (6ad68de23) audit chain.
// LaH10 + Li2MgH16: no composed QFORGE λ measured yet → sentinel -1.0 (PENDING).

// CaH6 — QFORGE-NC composed real-cell λ MEASURED (honest, outside the 1% bar).
// 2026-06-02 (QFORGE-PERF.log.md, d6 NOT tuned): dense-k CONVERGED composed all-4-brick
//   λ = 3.45443 @ 6x6x6 MP k (NPW=64 SCF converged, N(E_F)=13.0909, ω_log=1030.18 K,
//   Anderson-screened ΔV[d]). rel-ε vs QE 2.27 = 0.5218 (now ~+52% ABOVE; was −49% below
